---
export const title = 'Actionable and link cards';
export const order = 300;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  Add <code>actionable</code> to make the whole card one button. It fires <code>click</code>, shows
  hover and press states, and its content becomes inert, so don’t put buttons or links inside it.
  When a card needs more than one action, use a static card with its own buttons instead.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <div class='card-demo-grid' id='template-picker'>
    <wc-card variant='outlined' actionable data-template='Blank page'>
      <wc-card-content class='card-demo-body'>
        <wc-icon class='card-demo-icon' name='draft'></wc-icon>
        <h3 class='text-title-medium'>Blank page</h3>
        <p class='text-body-medium card-demo-muted'>Start from an empty canvas.</p>
      </wc-card-content>
    </wc-card>

    <wc-card variant='outlined' actionable data-template='Landing page'>
      <wc-card-content class='card-demo-body'>
        <wc-icon class='card-demo-icon' name='web'></wc-icon>
        <h3 class='text-title-medium'>Landing page</h3>
        <p class='text-body-medium card-demo-muted'>A hero, three features and a sign-up form.</p>
      </wc-card-content>
    </wc-card>

    <wc-card variant='outlined' actionable data-template='Blog post'>
      <wc-card-content class='card-demo-body'>
        <wc-icon class='card-demo-icon' name='article'></wc-icon>
        <h3 class='text-title-medium'>Blog post</h3>
        <p class='text-body-medium card-demo-muted'>A title, a cover image and long-form text.</p>
      </wc-card-content>
    </wc-card>
  </div>

  <p id='template-choice' class='text-body-medium' aria-live='polite'>No template chosen yet.</p>

  <script is:inline>
    document.getElementById('template-picker').addEventListener('click', event => {
      const card = event.target.closest('wc-card[data-template]');
      if (!card) return;
      document.getElementById('template-choice').textContent =
        'Selected: ' + card.dataset.template;
    });
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>

<h3 class='text-title-medium'>Link cards</h3>
<p>
  Set <code>href</code> instead to make the card a link, and screen readers announce it as one.
  <code>target</code>, <code>rel</code> and <code>download</code> work as they do on
  <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <div class='card-demo-grid'>
    <wc-card variant='filled' href='/foundations/color/'>
      <wc-card-content class='card-demo-body'>
        <wc-icon class='card-demo-icon' name='palette'></wc-icon>
        <h3 class='text-title-medium'>Color</h3>
        <p class='text-body-medium card-demo-muted'>
          Color roles, tonal palettes and how the theme engine builds them.
        </p>
      </wc-card-content>
    </wc-card>

    <wc-card variant='filled' href='/theme-builder/'>
      <wc-card-content class='card-demo-body'>
        <wc-icon class='card-demo-icon' name='format_paint'></wc-icon>
        <h3 class='text-title-medium'>Theme builder</h3>
        <p class='text-body-medium card-demo-muted'>Generate a full theme from one source color.</p>
      </wc-card-content>
    </wc-card>
  </div>
</DemoComponentCard>
